      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I've got these rough transcripts from some of our recent customer service calls. We need to get them ready for the official training manual, but some of them are a mess and hard to follow. Can you take this one and rewrite it into professional, high-level business English so it looks right for the docs?\n\nTranscript:\n\"Yeah so i was lookin at my bill and it dont even make sense. i been payin this same amount for like months but then suddenly it jump up out nowhere. i called last week and they told me it was a mistake but it still there. i need someone to fix this right now cuz i aint tryin to pay extra for nothing.\"",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
